  "statement": {
    "title": "index_copy decomposition rejects a zero-dimensional index",
    "body": "Native index_copy accepts either a one-dimensional index tensor or a scalar index. The decomposition validates both ranks but forwards a scalar directly to index_put, whose tuple indexing path expects a one-dimensional tensor. Normalize a scalar index to length one before constructing the index tuple.",
